    "homeType": "SINGLE_FAMILY",
    "description": "Bask in breathtaking panoramic views from this bright and airy Merced Heights home, perched directly across from scenic Brooks Park. Overlooking the ocean, Marin Headlands, city skyline, with views stretching all the way to Mt. Diablo, this charming two-bedroom, one-bath residence blends comfort, style, and potential. Located on a quiet, desirable block, 414 Shields offers both tranquility and convenience just minutes from Ocean Avenue's shops, restaurants, public transit, and the award-winning Jose Ortega Elementary School. The home features a spacious living room with abundant natural light, two bedrooms, one bath and remodeled eat in kitchen with stainless steel appliances, including Frigidaire gas range and refrigerator and Bosch dishwasher. Sliding glass doors lead to the large redwood deck, a perfect place for entertaining. The deck spans the length of the home from the kitchen to the bedroom and features panoramic views to the Ocean, Point Reyes, Mount Tam, city lights and Mount Diablo. The first floor features a two car garage, laundry area and ample space for expansion potential. The large deep backyard awaits your green touch! Truly a gem, not to be missed!"
  },
